---
// TechStack.astro
---

<section class="flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[rgba(35,23,39,0.7)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md" id="habilidades">
  {/* Header */}
  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-2 pb-4 border-b border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.25)]">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#c084fc]">
        <span>[ Qué herramientas uso y para qué sirven ]</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold text-[#F8F4E9] mt-1">
        Cómo construyo soluciones
      </h2>
    </div>
    <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[rgba(246,219,192,0.65)]">
      Enfoque práctico: del concepto a la operación
    </span>
  </div>

  {/* 4 Functional Pillars Grid */}
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-2">
    {/* Pilar 1: IA y Modelos */}
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-xl bg-[rgba(80,45,85,0.2)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.25)] hover:border-[#c084fc]/50 transition-all">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[rgba(192,132,252,0.15)] flex items-center justify-center text-[#c084fc] font-mono text-sm font-bold">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#F8F4E9]">
          Inteligencia Artificial y Agentes
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#F6DBC0] leading-relaxed">
          Cerebros de IA capaces de entender texto, analizar documentos o código, y tomar decisiones autónomas útiles sin alucinar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.2)] flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-[#c084fc]">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">PyTorch</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">RAG</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Agentes</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">ChromaDB</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 2: Automatización y Procesos */}
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-xl bg-[rgba(80,45,85,0.2)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.25)] hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/15 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#F8F4E9]">
          Automatización y Lógica Rápida
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#F6DBC0] leading-relaxed">
          Motores que conectan sistemas, optimizan procesos pesados y resuelven cálculos o tareas repetitivas en milisegundos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.2)] flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-emerald-400">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Python</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">FastAPI</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">C++</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Optimización</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 3: Aplicaciones Web */}
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-xl bg-[rgba(80,45,85,0.2)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.25)] hover:border-[#38bdf8]/50 transition-all">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/15 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-400 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#F8F4E9]">
          Pantallas y Experiencia de Usuario
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#F6DBC0] leading-relaxed">
          Páginas web y tableros interactivos claros y sencillos donde cualquier persona puede ver sus resultados y usar el sistema.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.2)] flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-sky-400">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">React</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Astro</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Tailwind</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 4: Datos y Nube */}
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between p-5 rounded-xl bg-[rgba(80,45,85,0.2)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.25)] hover:border-amber-400/50 transition-all">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/15 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-300 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
          04
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#F8F4E9]">
          Datos y Servidores Seguros
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#F6DBC0] leading-relaxed">
          Almacenamiento protegido, bases de datos confiables y servidores configurados para que la aplicación funcione siempre.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.2)] flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-amber-300">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Supabase</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Docker</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[rgba(26,15,30,0.7)]">Vercel</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
